id=auradsp_jdsp
name=AuraDSP Engines (Root)
version=v0.4.0
versionCode=4
author=AuraDSP Project
description=AuraDSP Engines (Root) — global audio effects engine (JamesDSP core) injected as an AIDL effects HAL library. Persists across reboot: tmpfs overlay on /vendor/lib64/soundfx, odm audio_effects_config.xml bind-mount, and 9 SELinux rules permitting FMQ memfd sharing between hal_audio_default and audioserver. Companion app: AuraDSP.
